[00:09.58] What do you think I am
[00:12.26] Do you think I'm dreaming
[00:15.02] Don't you know I know
[00:17.73] What it is you're scheming
[00:20.51] Who d'you think gave you the right
[00:23.18] Hidden by the dead of night
[00:25.99] To take the world and
[00:27.29] Turn it upside down
[00:30.70] When it should be round
[00:34.52] Seems I made it just in time
[00:37.23] To use my reason and my rhyme
[00:39.99] To save us from
[00:40.86] The evils of your mind
[00:48.95] I will cast the spell
[00:51.51] Be sure I'll cast it well
[00:54.29] I will light a fire
[00:57.12] Kindled with desire
[01:00.09] I'll fill you with fear
[01:02.56] So you know I'm here
[01:05.53] And I won't be treated like a fool
[01:11.21] It's no good you pretending
[01:13.43] There'll be no happy ending
[01:16.90] I'm alive and darkness is my tool
[04:12.48] But when the night is over
[04:18.95] And daytime steals your cover
[04:25.74] The goodness of the morning sun
[04:32.41] Will warm away
[04:35.86] What you have done
[04:39.11] And leave you cold
[05:19.38] I have no need for moonlight
[05:25.76] You're wrong to trust in sunlight
[05:32.28] For I exist not just in storms
[05:38.84] But in life itself in so many forms
[05:45.29] To leave you cold
[06:14.33] I will leave you now
[06:17.16] But you won't defeat me
[06:20.07] You had best beware
[06:22.82] When you come to meet me
[06:25.75] Love and truth will follow me
[06:28.55] An army of reality
[06:31.53] Brought from every corner
[06:33.38] Of the world
[06:40.25] You will never break the spell
[06:42.99] I'll summon all the fires of hell
[06:45.82] And this is my advice
[06:47.65] For what it's worth
[06:54.89] Let us not begin
[07:00.15] This fight we cannot win
[07:05.74] Be sure you're watching me
[07:11.73] 'Cause all through your life
[07:15.08] Everyday and everynight
[07:17.86] You should know that
[07:19.26] I'll be watching you
[07:29.18] 